redit"}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":["We may offer a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"refund, partial refund, or account credit"}]," when something is clearly wrong on our side or with billing, such as:"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Duplicate charge"}]," for the same product or period"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Technical failure"}]," that prevented you from using what you paid for for a meaningful period, and we could not reasonably fix it in time"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Billing error"}]," (for example, you were charged the wrong amount or charged after you had already cancelled according to our records)"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Other exceptional cases"}]," we judge in good faithâ€”usually rare, and decided case by case"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":["We ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"do not"}]," guarantee a refund in every situation. Each request is reviewed on its facts."]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-2",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-2",{"children":"3. Monthly subscriptions"}],"\n",["$","p","p-7",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Cancellation."}]," You can cancel your subscription at any time through the method we provide (for example, a billing portal or account settings). ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"After a successful cancellation, you will not be charged for future billing periods."}]," Cancellation does not automatically refund the ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"current"}]," period you already paid forâ€”you typically keep access until the end of that period unless we agree otherwise or an exception in section 2 applies."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-8",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Unused time."}]," We generally ","$L3"," refund â€œunusedâ€ days in a month 